The Ubiquiti EdgeRouter 4 is a powerful router based on the Cavium Octeon III platform. The quadcore MIPS64 CN7130 can do gigabit routing. The EdgeRouter 4 offers three regular gigabit Ethernet ports and one SFP port in a modest form factor and a fanless design. Cavium is a Marvell subsidiary since 2018.

